    how: "Identify the owner of mutable state and copy only the paths that change, preserving unchanged references intentionally. Use suitable immutable structures or controlled update helpers where complexity warrants them. Understand structuredClone's supported values and transfer behavior before using it. Validate external data separately; copying an object does not establish trust or remove dangerous meaning.",
