    summary: "Separate code delivery, traffic exposure, and business activation with real rollback constraints.",
    what: "Blue-green deployment maintains separate deployment environments for traffic switching. A canary exposes a limited portion of traffic before wider rollout. A feature flag controls selected behavior independently from deployment, but does not automatically undo persisted effects.",
